{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05191","headline":"咏屏风 · 袁恕己","name":"咏屏风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绮阁云霞满，芳林草树新。\n鸟惊疑欲曙，花笑不关春。\n山对弹琴客，谿留垂钓人。\n请看车马客，行处有风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁恕己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}